Package: WinShiny
Type: Package
Title: Shiny-Compatible Native Windows GUI Backend via PowerShell/WPF
Version: 0.6.11
Authors@R: person('Alek', 'Rutkowski', role = c('aut', 'cre'), email = 'alek.rutkowski@gmail.com')
Description: Experimental Shiny-compatible API subset that renders native Windows GUI controls through PowerShell/WPF instead of a web browser. This package deliberately follows the public shape of Shiny inputs, outputs, render functions, and reactivity, but replaces the browser backend with a WPF runtime.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: ggplot2
SystemRequirements: Windows with Windows PowerShell or PowerShell
NeedsCompilation: no
